31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? Or did the wolf keep you up?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I slept fine, but I'm worried about today.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm fine. Let's get to the voting.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Um, everyone... I have something to say. I'm the Seer.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"So soon? You're quite bold, Mio.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa, really?! Mio is the Seer? That's so cool!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Oh, thank goodness. We have a Seer to guide us.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, if you're the Seer, then you must have found something. Tell us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,I divined Takumi last night... and he is the Werewolf.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A direct hit on the first night. That's efficient, if true.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,No way! Takumi is the wolf? I can't believe it!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minato,,Really? Takumi... is that true?,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,What?! That's a lie! Mio is just trying to frame me to look like a hero!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm not lying! I saw it clearly!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Takumi's reaction is a bit aggressive, which is typical, but the evidence is direct.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I trust Mio! Let's catch the bad wolf!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,I... I think I have to believe the Seer.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You're all idiots! You're falling for her trap!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm sorry, Takumi, but we have to protect the village.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The logic is simple. Unless Mio is the wolf lying about being the Seer, Takumi must go.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
